### Problem File Convention

Each Java file = one LeetCode problem, named by problem (e.g., `TwoSum.java`).

Header comment is added **after solving** (retrospective, not a hint):

```java
/**
 * Problem: Two Sum (LC #1)
 * Link: https://leetcode.com/problems/two-sum/
 * Pattern: Arrays, HashMap
 * Difficulty: Easy
 * Time: O(n) | Space: O(n)
 * Key Insight: Trade space for time using a complement map
 */
```

